{"title":"Basilisk Matriarch","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 27 Basilisk that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/basilisk-matriarch\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/basilisk-matriarch?lv=27\">Lv 27</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/basilisk-matriarch?lv=30\">Lv 30 <span>4</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/basilisk-matriarch?lv=27\" title=\"Pick level 27\"><td><b>27</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>100</td><td>19.4</td><td>1,350</td><td class=\"muted\">300 · 27.2 · 4,050</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/basilisk-matriarch\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>30</b></td><td>118</td><td>21</td><td>1,500</td><td class=\"muted\">354 · 29.4 · 4,500</td><td>4</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/the-mother-of-stone\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/3feaaab0e2d4d8f2444e.svg\" alt=\"\"><b>The Mother of Stone</b><span>Lv 30</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Basilisk: <a href=\"#/monster/basilisk-gazebound\">Gazebound Basilisk</a> <span class=\"muted\">(25)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/sand-basilisk\">Sand Basilisk</a> <span class=\"muted\">(26)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/basilisk\">Basilisk</a> <span class=\"muted\">(31)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/elder-basilisk\">Elder Basilisk</a> <span class=\"muted\">(36)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/ed8e7c7e93bec8db01e2.svg\" alt=\"Basilisk Matriarch\"></div><h3>Basilisk Matriarch</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>30</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 27)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Basilisk</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>118</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>21</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1,500</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.8 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>1 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}